      "text": "Critical Hit\nIn role-playing games using dice, rolling a 20 on a 20-sided dice\n is sometimes referred to as rolling a critical hit. For this exercise,\n build a pipeline that would log Critical Hit when the result of a dice\n roll is 20. To do so, use a task that will generate a random number\n between 1 and 20 and produce a result that the when expression of a second task can pick up.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Critical Hit\nIn role-playing games using dice, rolling a 20 on a 20-sided dice\n is sometimes referred to as rolling a critical hit. For this exercise,\n build a pipeline that would log Critical Hit when the result of a dice\n roll is 20. To do so, use a task that will generate a random number\n between 1 and 20 and produce a result that the when expression of a second task can pick up.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
